WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.335 --> 00:00:03.169
<i>Three,</i>

00:00:03.253 --> 00:00:04.462
<i>two, one...</i>

00:00:04.796 --> 00:00:06.339
This is <i>Sugar Rush.</i>

00:00:06.423 --> 00:00:07.924
<i>Four teams of brilliant bakers</i>

00:00:08.007 --> 00:00:09.384
<i>compete against each other</i>

00:00:09.467 --> 00:00:10.677
<i>and the clock</i>

00:00:10.760 --> 00:00:12.470
<i>over three rounds of competition.</i>

00:00:12.554 --> 00:00:14.347 position:66%
Why do I feel like time speeds up in here?

00:00:14.431 --> 00:00:15.974 position:56%
Whatever speed you're at, double it.

00:00:16.057 --> 00:00:17.559
<i>Round one, cupcakes.</i>

00:00:18.143 --> 00:00:19.894
That is quite a presentation.

00:00:21.312 --> 00:00:23.356
Don't have too much fun 'cause
you need to win $10,000.

00:00:23.440 --> 00:00:24.274
Okay.

00:00:24.357 --> 00:00:25.650
<i>And round two, confections.</i>

00:00:25.734 --> 00:00:26.776
Oh, that was off the chain.

00:00:26.860 --> 00:00:29.070
I think they just hit the nail
on the head with this theme.

00:00:29.154 --> 00:00:31.114 position:59%
This is, like, an Instagrammers dream.

00:00:31.197 --> 00:00:32.907
<i>Third and final round, cakes.</i>

00:00:32.991 --> 00:00:34.242
<i>It's cake time.</i>

00:00:34.325 --> 00:00:35.285
We have no time.

00:00:35.368 --> 00:00:36.327
<i>This is a horse race.</i>

00:00:36.411 --> 00:00:38.204
<i>I have never made a wedding cake</i>

00:00:38.288 --> 00:00:39.164
in three hours.

00:00:39.247 --> 00:00:40.665
Oh, this part makes me so nervous.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:44.377 position:58%
<i>My hands are shaking trying
to put these decorations on the cake.</i>

00:00:45.587 --> 00:00:46.463
What happened?

00:00:46.546 --> 00:00:47.505
Uh...

00:00:47.589 --> 00:00:49.299
-We're not bothering--
-Stop bothering him!

00:00:49.382 --> 00:00:50.717 position:61%
Feeling the pressure, feeling the heat?

00:00:50.800 --> 00:00:52.051 position:56%
Aren't you guys done yet over there?

00:00:52.135 --> 00:00:54.137
Now it's a competition for real.

00:00:54.471 --> 00:00:55.305
Are you okay?

00:00:55.388 --> 00:00:56.222
You're a mess.

00:00:56.306 --> 00:00:57.265
I'm feeling very judged.

00:00:57.348 --> 00:00:58.808
The team going home today

00:00:58.892 --> 00:00:59.809
is going to be...

00:01:01.686 --> 00:01:02.812
This is nerve-racking.

00:01:02.896 --> 00:01:04.063
With the long pause.

00:01:05.023 --> 00:01:06.024
Come on!

